{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02397","headline":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 · 僧皎然","name":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"予因览真诀，遂感西域君。\n玉笙下青冥，人间未曾闻。\n日华链魂魄，皎皎无垢氛。\n谓我有仙骨，且令饵氤氲。\n俯仰媿灵颜，愿随鸾鹤羣。\n俄然动风驭，缥眇归青云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}